# Accepted vulnerabilities for the dependency and image scans (docs/operations/supply-chain.md).
#
# A finding is only listed here when it cannot be fixed or does not apply, and every entry needs
# the advisory id, a reason and an expiry date, so it comes back for review:
#
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31
#   # reason: the vulnerable class is not reachable (we only use X); fix expected in Y; owner: ...
#
# Nothing is accepted at the moment.
